					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: BASIC ATTACK RELEASE\n\nIn this example we are using a Metronome to trigger the Attack Release node, which modulates the radius of a Circle shape.\nNote that \"Restart At 0\" is enabled.\nTry disabling it to see the difference in behavior."
					}
				},
